abstract: >-
  Huub is an efficient library for developing
  constraint-based decision or optimization systems and
  applications with learning capabilities. It combines the
  modelling strengths of constraint programming (CP) with
  the learning and proof machinery of Boolean satisfiability
  (SAT) solving.
